OL,3,GNEWSACow rescued after falling into
OL,4,Aswimming pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cow was rescued by fire fighters
OL,7,Fafter escaping and falling into a
OL,8,Fgarden swimming pool.
OL,10,FThe 600kg (1,322lb) cow fell into the
OL,11,F1.2m (3ft 11ins) deep pool in a garden
OL,12,Fin Coverack, Cornwall, fire crews said.
OL,14,FTwo appliances from St Keverne were
OL,15,Fcalled at 01:18 GMT on Wednesday and
OL,16,Fsecured the animal using ropes before
OL,17,Fusing a portable pump to reduce the
OL,18,Fwater level in the pool by 50%.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
